        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 14:5",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 14,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "Turn from him, that he may rest, till he shall accomplish, as an hireling, his day.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 65,
            "end": 73,
            "text": "Job 7:1 (1–2)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 14:6",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 14,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "For there is hope of a tree, if it be cut down, that it will sprout again, and that the tender branch thereof will not cease.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 14:7",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 14,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "Though the root thereof wax old in the earth, and the stock thereof die in the ground;",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 14:8",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 14,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "Yet through the scent of water it will bud, and bring forth boughs like a plant.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 3
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 14:9",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 14,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "But man dieth, and wasteth away: yea, man giveth up the ghost, and where is he?",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 8,
            "end": 13,
            "text": "Alma 11:45; 40:11 (11–14); D&C 76:73 (71–74)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 73,
            "end": 75
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 14:10",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 14,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "As the waters fail from the sea, and the flood decayeth and drieth up:",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 2
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 14:11",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 14,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "So man lieth down, and riseth not: till the heavens be no more, they shall not awake, nor be raised out of their sleep.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 52,
            "end": 54
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 12,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 14:12",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 14,
        "verse": 12
      },
      {
        "text": "O that thou wouldest hide me in the grave, that thou wouldest keep me secret, until thy wrath be past, that thou wouldest appoint me a set time, and remember me!",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 13,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 14:13",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 14,
        "verse": 13
      },
      {
        "text": "If a man die, shall he live again? all the days of my appointed time will I wait, till my change come.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 23,
            "end": 27,
            "text": "TG Resurrection."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 28,
            "end": 34
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 14,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "TG Resurrection.",
            "prettyString": "TG Resurrection",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
                "studyHelpType": "tg",
